# Real market data is large (hundreds of MB to multiple GB) and not
# something we want to commit -- everything under data/ is a downloaded or
# decompressed input file, never a build artifact we author. Only small
# derived summaries (e.g. message-type mix reports) get committed, from
# wherever they're written outside this directory.
/data/
